y","s":["H5892"],"a":[15]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":9,"text":"And they will say, It is because they forsook the covenant of Jehovah their God and bowed down to other gods and served them.","tok":[{"t":"And they will say, It is because they forsook the "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and bowed down to "},{"t":"other","s":["H0312"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"gods","s":["H0430"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"served","s":["H5647"],"a":[11]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Do not weep for the one who died, nor lament for him; But weep bitterly for the one who goes away, For he will no longer return and see The land of his birth.","tok":[{"t":"Do not "},{"t":"weep","s":["H1058"],"a":[1]},{"t":" for the one who died, nor lament for him; But "},{"t":"weep","s":["H1058"],"a":[6]},{"t":" bitterly for the one who goes "},{"t":"away","s":["H1980"],"a":[8]},{"t":", For he will no longer "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[13]},{"t":" The land of his birth."}]},{"n":11,"text":"For thus says Jehovah concerning Shallum the son of Josiah, the king of Judah, who became king in the place of Josiah his father, who went away from this place: He will not return there anymore;","tok":[{"t":"For thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"concerning","s":["H0413"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Shallum","s":["H7967"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Josiah","s":["H2977"],"a":[7]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[9]},{"t":", who became king in the place of "},{"t":"Josiah","s":["H2977"],"a":[12]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"father","s":["H0001"],"a":[13]},{"t":", who went away from this "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[17]},{"t":": He will not "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[20]},{"t":" there anymore;"}]},{"n":12,"text":"But in the place where they have exiled him he will die and never see this land again.","tok":[{"t":"But in the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[1]},{"t":" where they have exiled him he will "},{"t":"die","s":["H4191"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and never "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[11]},{"t":" this "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[8]},{"t":" again."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Woe to him who builds his house by unrighteousness And his upper rooms by injustice, Who uses his neighbor’s service without wages And does not give him recompense for his work,","tok":[{"t":"Woe","s":["H1945"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to him who "},{"t":"builds","s":["H1129"],"a":[1]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"by","s":["H3808"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"unrighteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[4]},{"t":" And his upper rooms by injustice, Who uses his neighbor’s "},{"t":"service","s":["H5647"],"a":[9]},{"t":" without "},{"t":"wages","s":["H2600"],"a":[10]},{"t":" And does not "},{"t":"give","s":["H5414"],"a":[13]},{"t":" him recompense for his "},{"t":"work","s":["H6467"],"a":[11]},{"t":","}]},{"n":14,"text":"Who says, I will build myself a large house With spacious upper chambers, And cuts out for it windows; and it is paneled with cedar And painted with vermilion.","tok":[{"t":"Who "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", I will "},{"t":"build","s":["H1129"],"a":[1]},{"t":" myself a "},{"t":"large","s":["H7304"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[3]},{"t":" With spacious upper "},{"t":"chambers","s":["H5944"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And cuts "},{"t":"out","s":["H7167"],"a":[7]},{"t":" for it "},{"t":"windows","s":["H2474"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; and it is "},{"t":"paneled","s":["H5603"],"a":[10]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"cedar","s":["H0730"],"a":[11]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"painted","s":["H4886"],"a":[12]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"vermilion","s":["H8350"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"Are you a king because you Excel in cedar? Di